#-  §5✐ Authors Lament ✐
§d****************************§
§8There exists a humble marvel: §6The Sweetpea.

§8Under the cloak of §0The Darkness§8, roots venture forth, inching §5ɨȶ §8more & more towards the unknown.

Their petals unfurl 
like the pages of a long-lost manuscript.
#- §8Defying gravity's tether with tenacious grace. Their strange resilience, weaves a tapestry in the quest to touch the heavens.

For §5ɨȶ §8is not merely '§6sweetness§8' that lies within these ethereal petals. 

In superstition, this flower is magical...
#- §5ɨȶ §8is a whispered enchantment that dances upon the air that could provide wisdom & truth.

Unlock the secrets and mysteries of forgotten realms.

For §6The Sweetpea§8, 
the magic lies not in spells cast or 
potions brewed...
#- §5ɨȶ §8whispers in dreams unfulfilled upon those who dare to listen.

The ordinary transforms into the extraordinary. The natural into the supernatural!

They flourish in adversity, bending 
but never breaking...
§4NEVER ENDING...§r
#- §8Trellises to meadows, their celestial dance embraces both §5chaos §8and §6order§8.

And so, let us heed the gentle call of 
§6The Sweetpea§8, the profound truth...

Even the most fragile of creations can wield a power beyond measure!
#- §8I guess, what 'we' are trying to say is...§r§
